        <p class="eyebrow">About the podcast</p>
        <h2>Real stories. Honest conversations. Nothing hidden.</h2>
        <p class="lede">The Unmasked Podcast is a space for conversations that move beyond appearances and make room for what is real.</p>
        <p>Through relaxed conversations, personal stories, informed voices, and practical resources, the show explores mental health with honesty, compassion, and humor. Every episode is an invitation to remove the metaphorical masks that keep people isolated and to remember that no one should have to navigate life alone.</p>
        <blockquote class="quote">“When we share what is real, we give someone else permission to do the same.”</blockquote>
        <p>Listen, share an episode with someone who needs it, and join Unmasked Culture as we continue creating spaces where people can be fully seen and fully human.</p>
